# Persistent self-host setup uses a protected mode-0600 JSON answers file, or prompts:
# ./myskills.sh setup --config-dir /absolute/private/directory --answers-file /absolute/answers.json
# JSON string fields: APP_BASE_URL, VITE_API_BASE_URL, TRUST_PROXY,
# AUTH_NOTIFICATION_MODE (smtp or resend), SMTP_HOST, SMTP_PORT, SMTP_FROM,
# SMTP_USER, SMTP_PASSWORD, RESEND_API_KEY, RESEND_FROM, SEED_OWNER_EMAIL,
# SEED_OWNER_PASSWORD. Optional: MYSKILLS_COMPOSE_PROJECT, WEB_PORT.
# Values cannot contain newline, backslash or single quote. Do not use secret CLI arguments.
# Setup generates database, auth and object-storage credentials; do not copy development defaults.
# The generated runtime.env is mode 0600 inside a mode-0700 config directory.
# The public web/API endpoints need an operator-managed HTTPS reverse proxy.
# Evaluation mode and automatic TLS provisioning are outside this helper's scope.
APP_BASE_URL='https://replace-with-your-domain'
VITE_API_BASE_URL='/api'
TRUST_PROXY='replace-with-trusted-proxy-ip-or-cidr'
AUTH_NOTIFICATION_MODE='smtp'
SMTP_HOST='replace-with-mail-host'
SMTP_PORT='587'
SMTP_FROM='replace-with-verified-sender'
SMTP_USER='replace-with-mail-user'
SMTP_PASSWORD='replace-with-mail-password'
# For Resend use AUTH_NOTIFICATION_MODE=resend, RESEND_API_KEY and RESEND_FROM.
# Optional HTTP MCP: set MYSKILLS_ENABLE_MCP='true' and
# MCP_PROXY_TARGET='http://mcp-http:3002' in the protected runtime.env.
# Each client supplies its own scoped bearer token after owner sign-in; the server
# does not store a shared client token. The web ingress forwards /mcp with HTTPS.
# Keep MYSKILLS_MCP_ALLOWED_HOSTS='mcp-http:3002' and exact allowed origins.
# Backups: create protected config/backup.env (0600); never store it in the bundle.
# MYSKILLS_BACKUP_INSTANCE_ID='exact-migrated-database-instance_id-uuid'
# backup config checks this value against the database's exact identity; run up first.
# MYSKILLS_RECOVERY_BACKUP_S3_ENDPOINT='https://external-backup-storage'
# MYSKILLS_RECOVERY_BACKUP_S3_BUCKET='separate-backup-bucket'
# MYSKILLS_RECOVERY_BACKUP_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID='backup-access-key'
# MYSKILLS_RECOVERY_BACKUP_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY='backup-secret-key'
# Configure a schedule separately. Same-host storage does not establish backup durability.
